<title>INDIA: Delhi shares surge after strong results.</title>
<headline>Delhi shares surge after strong results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delhi shares closed higher in active trade on Wednesday, spurred by better than expected results of Ranbaxy Laboratories and Apollo Tyres, brokers said.</p>
<p>The Delhi Stock Exchange's sensitive index closed 9.32 points higher at 820.42.</p>
